  known_gap the document source package still needs clean-machine installation and user validation; its current build recipe targets Apple Silicon macOS with separately installed Bun, Homebrew SQLite and ONNX Runtime, and the pinned model in the user's cache
  forbidden_inference source packaging or a fresh-directory build on the developer Mac -> public release, clean-machine portability, complete licensing review, Linux or Windows support, representative user success or an awarded grant
