  witness 2026-10-07 the same catalogue-browser.test.mjs ran with CATALOGUE_TEST_ORIGIN=https://aurekai-work-samples.pages.dev and passed all 26 checks against the published workspace, using real pointer and keyboard title edits, browser restart and isolated stale-tab, failed-request and corrupted-chunk tests; the run observed no external writes; result is packs/aurekai-work-samples/site/design/verification-live/browser-verification.json
