  witness 2026-10-07 catalogue-review.test.mjs exercises generated intake, repeat receipts, rejected submissions, failed storage, site enrichment and the compiled CMS with an isolated database; full submitted changes survive the round trip. The local catalogue-browser.test.mjs passes 42 checks including failed submission, retry, reload and desktop/mobile review forms; packs/aurekai-work-samples/site/design/verification-review-local/browser-verification.json
  witness 2026-10-07 the published catalogue passed 41 browser checks, including failed submit, successful retry, reload returning the same receipt and desktop/mobile review layouts. Receipt lead:catalogue:0193b6b913446f7fe1c91a81ce66089414886b75c49535d2692705a0ec9ea425 became service_lead 10 and held outbound_message 25 in namespace service-site; a second live sync brought=0 and prepared=0 with errors=[] across both Cloudflare accounts. Test records are handled and abandoned respectively, with no message sent. Evidence: packs/aurekai-work-samples/site/design/verification-review-live/browser-verification.json and native-review-verification.json
  invariant a catalogue source may declare its legacy product path and on-origin image path; product links retain their observed address and another hostname, credentials or path traversal cannot satisfy that declaration
  witness 2026-10-07 components/BonfyreServiceSite/tests/catalogue-model.test.mjs passes 11 tests and 46 assertions including declared legacy paths, unchanged source URLs and rejected host/path substitutions
  witness 2026-10-07 components/BonfyreServiceSite/tests/catalogue-browser.test.mjs passes 32 checks; RED3 Display product 7631 opens through the same editor, retains its 19.50 source price and missing public fields, and can be edited, reviewed, saved and reopened after reload
  invariant a received catalogue submission is remembered in the shared browser store under its form and exact saved-version digest; reopening that version restores the receipt without a new request, while changed drafts and other stores do not inherit it
  witness 2026-10-08 receipt history was deployed through site.mjs publish to aurekai-work-samples, deployment 0f79618c-2a94-444d-9f59-1e7807caa02d; 52 published browser checks pass, including receipt restoration after restart without another submission. The marked live RED3 draft retained all seven changes as service_lead 11 and held outbound_message 51; a second sync creates nothing. Test records are handled and abandoned, and the remote test intake copy was removed. Evidence packs/aurekai-work-samples/site/design/verification-receipt-history-live/browser-verification.json and native-handoff.json
  forbidden_inference local submission history -> reviewer approval, shared editing, a live review-status service or permission to publish merchant changes
  witness 2026-10-08 catalogue-browser.test.mjs first lost the receipt after reload, then passed 57 local checks after receipt history and shared-store error handling were added; the run covers a sent-for-review filter, restart without resubmission, changed-version and cross-store separation, failed local receipt write after server acceptance, and idempotent retry; evidence packs/aurekai-work-samples/site/design/verification-receipt-history-local/browser-verification.json

